Cell["Diagram Networks", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"55ac127b-4e92-4bba-90d8-0d6fb4d73563"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Rather than arranging diagrams in a grid-like fashion, there is a more \
flexible way to wire arbitrary ports using ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["DiagramNetwork"]], 
    "paclet:WolframDiagrammaticComputation/ref/DiagramNetwork", 
    "WolframDiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e58d8cad-f80f-40e0-9d4d-d5cee43e8ed8"],
 ", which connects all equivalent ports independent of their position within \
or across all diagrams."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2a6e11cb-1bd4-4a1b-bd3b-af43a9188585"],

Cell["\<\
For example it is possible to create a loop by wiring input and output \
together:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"31ac7e26-e1db-4c98-81d4-5801fed92c3a"],

